# GS-009: The same inert-gas addition behaves differently at fixed pressure
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
regulate v1 1bar 500mL
add v1 CO2 0.001mol
inspect v1
measure v1 pressure
add v1 N2 0.005mol
inspect v1
measure v1 pressure
measure v1 volume
inspect
